#: ../../modules/ml/ml_datasets.rst:41
msgid "NARMA"
msgstr "NARMA"

#: ../../modules/ml/ml_datasets.rst:43
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The Nonlinear Auto-Regressive Moving Average "
"(:class:`~qilisdk.ml.datasets.narma.NARMA`) benchmark is a system-"
"identification task. A random input stream :math:`u(t) \\sim "
"\\mathcal{U}(0, 0.5)` drives an order-:math:`n` nonlinear recurrence "
"whose output :math:`y(t)` must be predicted from :math:`u`:"
msgstr ""
"El punt de referència de mitjana mòbil autoregressiva no lineal "
"(:class:`~qilisdk.ml.datasets.narma.NARMA`) és una tasca d'identificació "
"de sistemes. Un flux d'entrada aleatori :math:`u(t) \\sim \\mathcal{U}(0,"
" 0.5)` acciona una recurrència no lineal d'ordre :math:`n` la sortida de "
"la qual, :math:`y(t)`, s'ha de predir a partir de :math:`u`:"

#: ../../modules/ml/ml_datasets.rst:47
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"y(t+1) = \\alpha\\, y(t)\n"
"         + \\beta\\, y(t) \\sum_{i=0}^{n-1} y(t-i)\n"
"         + \\gamma\\, u(t-n+1)\\, u(t)\n"
"         + \\delta."
msgstr ""
"y(t+1) = \\alpha\\, y(t)\n"
"         + \\beta\\, y(t) \\sum_{i=0}^{n-1} y(t-i)\n"
"         + \\gamma\\, u(t-n+1)\\, u(t)\n"
"         + \\delta."

#: ../../modules/ml/ml_datasets.rst:54
msgid ""
"The default coefficients :math:`(\\alpha, \\beta, \\gamma, \\delta) = "
"(0.3, 0.05, 1.5, 0.1)` correspond to the ubiquitous ``NARMA10`` task "
"(``order=10``). Unlike the other generators, ``inputs`` are the random "
"drive :math:`u` and ``targets`` are the system response :math:`y`; both "
"are shaped ``(npoints, 1)``. Because the drive is random, a ``seed`` can "
"be specified to ensure reproducibility."
msgstr ""
"Els coeficients per defecte :math:`(\\alpha, \\beta, \\gamma, \\delta) = "
"(0.3, 0.05, 1.5, 0.1)` corresponen a la ubiqua tasca ``NARMA10`` "
"(``order=10``). A diferència dels altres generadors, ``inputs`` és "
"l'accionament aleatori :math:`u` i ``targets`` és la resposta del sistema"
" :math:`y`; tots dos tenen forma ``(npoints, 1)``. Com que l'accionament "
"és aleatori, es pot especificar una ``seed`` per garantir la "
"reproductibilitat."

#: ../../modules/ml/ml_datasets.rst:66
msgid "MackeyGlass"
msgstr "MackeyGlass"

#: ../../modules/ml/ml_datasets.rst:68
msgid ""
"The :class:`~qilisdk.ml.datasets.mackey_glass.MackeyGlass` system is a "
"nonlinear delay differential equation that produces a chaotic attractor:"
msgstr ""
"El sistema :class:`~qilisdk.ml.datasets.mackey_glass.MackeyGlass` és una "
"equació diferencial amb retard no lineal que produeix un atractor caòtic:"

#: ../../modules/ml/ml_datasets.rst:71
msgid ""
"\\frac{dx}{dt} = \\beta\\, \\frac{x(t - \\tau)}{1 + x(t - \\tau)^{n}}\n"
"                - \\gamma\\, x(t)."
msgstr ""
"\\frac{dx}{dt} = \\beta\\, \\frac{x(t - \\tau)}{1 + x(t - \\tau)^{n}}\n"
"                - \\gamma\\, x(t)."

#: ../../modules/ml/ml_datasets.rst:76
msgid ""
"With the standard parameters :math:`\\beta = 0.2`, :math:`\\gamma = 0.1`,"
" :math:`n = 10`, the behaviour is set by the delay :math:`\\tau`: the "
"series is periodic for small :math:`\\tau`, mildly chaotic at "
":math:`\\tau = 17`, and increasingly chaotic beyond. The equation is "
"integrated with a fixed-step RK4 scheme at resolution ``dt`` and sub-"
"sampled every ``sample_every`` steps."
msgstr ""
"Amb els paràmetres estàndard :math:`\\beta = 0.2`, :math:`\\gamma = 0.1`,"
" :math:`n = 10`, el comportament queda determinat pel retard "
":math:`\\tau`: la sèrie és periòdica per a :math:`\\tau` petits, "
"lleugerament caòtica a :math:`\\tau = 17` i cada vegada més caòtica més "
"enllà. L'equació s'integra amb un esquema RK4 de pas fix amb resolució "
"``dt`` i es submostreja cada ``sample_every`` passos."

#: ../../modules/ml/ml_datasets.rst:89
msgid "Lorenz"
msgstr "Lorenz"

#: ../../modules/ml/ml_datasets.rst:91
msgid ""
"The :class:`~qilisdk.ml.datasets.lorenz.Lorenz` attractor is a three-"
"dimensional chaotic dynamical system:"
msgstr ""
"L'atractor :class:`~qilisdk.ml.datasets.lorenz.Lorenz` és un sistema "
"dinàmic caòtic tridimensional:"

#: ../../modules/ml/ml_datasets.rst:93
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\\dot{x} = \\sigma (y - x), \\quad\n"
"\\dot{y} = x (\\rho - z) - y, \\quad\n"
"\\dot{z} = x y - \\beta z."
msgstr ""
"\\dot{x} = \\sigma (y - x), \\quad\n"
"\\dot{y} = x (\\rho - z) - y, \\quad\n"
"\\dot{z} = x y - \\beta z."

#: ../../modules/ml/ml_datasets.rst:99
msgid ""
"The trajectory is integrated with RK4 and sub-sampled, yielding a "
"``horizon``-step-ahead prediction task over the three-dimensional state, "
"so ``inputs`` and ``targets`` are both shaped ``(npoints, 3)``."
msgstr ""
"La trajectòria s'integra amb RK4 i es submostreja, donant lloc a una "
"tasca de predicció de ``horizon`` passos endavant sobre l'estat "
"tridimensional, de manera que ``inputs`` i ``targets`` tenen tots dos "
"forma ``(npoints, 3)``."

#: ../../modules/ml/ml_datasets.rst:110
msgid "SantaFeLaser"
msgstr "SantaFeLaser"

#: ../../modules/ml/ml_datasets.rst:112
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The original *Santa Fe Time Series Competition* Data Set A is a recording"
" of the chaotic intensity pulsations of a far-infrared "
":math:`\\mathrm{NH_3}` laser. Rather than shipping the recording, "
":class:`~qilisdk.ml.datasets.santa_fe_laser.SantaFeLaser` reproduces the "
"same qualitative dynamics from first principles using the single-mode "
"**Lorenz--Haken** laser equations:"
msgstr ""
"El conjunt de dades A original de la *Santa Fe Time Series Competition* "
"és un enregistrament de les pulsacions caòtiques d'intensitat d'un làser "
"de :math:`\\mathrm{NH_3}` d'infraroig llunyà. En lloc de distribuir "
"l'enregistrament, "
":class:`~qilisdk.ml.datasets.santa_fe_laser.SantaFeLaser` reprodueix la "
"mateixa dinàmica qualitativa des de primers principis mitjançant les "
"equacions de làser **Lorenz--Haken** d'un sol mode:"

#: ../../modules/ml/ml_datasets.rst:117
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\\dot{E} = \\sigma (P - E), \\quad\n"
"\\dot{P} = E (\\rho - N) - P, \\quad\n"
"\\dot{N} = E P - \\beta N,"
msgstr ""
"\\dot{E} = \\sigma (P - E), \\quad\n"
"\\dot{P} = E (\\rho - N) - P, \\quad\n"
"\\dot{N} = E P - \\beta N,"

#: ../../modules/ml/ml_datasets.rst:123
msgid ""
"where :math:`E` is the field amplitude, :math:`P` the polarization and "
":math:`N` the population inversion. The measured quantity is the laser "
"**intensity** :math:`I \\propto E^2`, which is non-negative and "
"reproduces the behaviour of the Santa Fe recording. Both ``inputs`` and "
"``targets`` are shaped ``(npoints, 1)``."
msgstr ""
"on :math:`E` és l'amplitud del camp, :math:`P` la polarització i "
":math:`N` la inversió de població. La magnitud mesurada és la "
"**intensitat** del làser :math:`I \\propto E^2`, que és no negativa i "
"reprodueix el comportament de l'enregistrament de Santa Fe. Tant "
"``inputs`` com ``targets`` tenen forma ``(npoints, 1)``."

#: ../../modules/ml/ml_datasets.rst:135
msgid "HenonMap"
msgstr "HenonMap"

#: ../../modules/ml/ml_datasets.rst:137
msgid ""
"The :class:`~qilisdk.ml.datasets.henon.HenonMap` is a two-dimensional "
"discrete chaotic system:"
msgstr ""
"El :class:`~qilisdk.ml.datasets.henon.HenonMap` és un sistema caòtic "
"discret bidimensional:"

#: ../../modules/ml/ml_datasets.rst:139
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"x_{n+1} = 1 - a\\, x_n^2 + y_n, \\qquad\n"
"y_{n+1} = b\\, x_n,"
msgstr ""
"x_{n+1} = 1 - a\\, x_n^2 + y_n, \\qquad\n"
"y_{n+1} = b\\, x_n,"

#: ../../modules/ml/ml_datasets.rst:144
msgid ""
"which is chaotic for the parameters :math:`a = 1.4`, :math:`b = 0.3`. "
":meth:`generate` returns a ``horizon``-step-ahead prediction task over "
"the two-dimensional state, so ``inputs`` and ``targets`` are both shaped "
"``(npoints, 2)``."
msgstr ""
"que és caòtic per als paràmetres :math:`a = 1.4`, :math:`b = 0.3`. "
":meth:`generate` retorna una tasca de predicció de ``horizon`` passos "
"endavant sobre l'estat bidimensional, de manera que ``inputs`` i "
"``targets`` tenen tots dos forma ``(npoints, 2)``."

#: ../../modules/ml/ml_datasets.rst:155
msgid "LogisticMap"
msgstr "LogisticMap"

#: ../../modules/ml/ml_datasets.rst:157
msgid ""
"The :class:`~qilisdk.ml.datasets.logistic_map.LogisticMap` is a simple "
"one-dimensional chaotic system:"
msgstr ""
"El :class:`~qilisdk.ml.datasets.logistic_map.LogisticMap` és un sistema "
"caòtic unidimensional senzill:"

#: ../../modules/ml/ml_datasets.rst:159
#, python-brace-format
msgid "x_{n+1} = r\\, x_n (1 - x_n),"
msgstr "x_{n+1} = r\\, x_n (1 - x_n),"

#: ../../modules/ml/ml_datasets.rst:163
msgid ""
"which becomes chaotic as the growth rate :math:`r` approaches 4 (the "
"default :math:`r = 3.9` sits well inside the chaotic regime). "
":meth:`generate` returns a ``horizon``-step-ahead prediction task, so "
"``inputs`` and ``targets`` are shaped ``(npoints, 1)``."
msgstr ""
"que esdevé caòtic a mesura que la taxa de creixement :math:`r` s'aproxima"
" a 4 (el valor per defecte :math:`r = 3.9` se situa ben endins del règim "
"caòtic). :meth:`generate` retorna una tasca de predicció de ``horizon`` "
"passos endavant, de manera que ``inputs`` i ``targets`` tenen forma "
"``(npoints, 1)``."

#: ../../modules/ml/ml_datasets.rst:175
msgid "Circle"
msgstr "Circle"

#: ../../modules/ml/ml_datasets.rst:177
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The :class:`~qilisdk.ml.datasets.circle.Circle` dataset is a two-"
"dimensional binary classification task. Points :math:`(x, y)` are sampled"
" uniformly from the unit square and labelled ``1`` if they lie inside a "
"circle of radius :math:`r` centred at :math:`(0.5, 0.5)`, and ``0`` "
"otherwise. The default radius :math:`r = 1 / \\sqrt{2\\pi}` makes the "
"circle cover half of the square, so the two classes are balanced. A "
"``margin`` leaves an empty band around the boundary, making the classes "
"easier to separate. ``inputs`` are the points, shaped ``(npoints, 2)``, "
"and ``targets`` are the labels, shaped ``(npoints, 1)``. When drawn, the "
"points are coloured by class."
msgstr ""
"El conjunt de dades :class:`~qilisdk.ml.datasets.circle.Circle` és una "
"tasca de classificació binària bidimensional. Els punts :math:`(x, y)` es"
" mostregen uniformement en el quadrat unitat i s'etiqueten amb ``1`` si "
"són dins d'un cercle de radi :math:`r` centrat a :math:`(0.5, 0.5)`, i "
"amb ``0`` en cas contrari. El radi per defecte :math:`r = 1 / "
"\\sqrt{2\\pi}` fa que el cercle cobreixi la meitat del quadrat, de manera"
" que les dues classes estan equilibrades. Un ``margin`` deixa una franja "
"buida al voltant de la frontera, cosa que facilita la separació de les "
"classes. ``inputs`` són els punts, amb forma ``(npoints, 2)``, i "
"``targets`` són les etiquetes, amb forma ``(npoints, 1)``. En dibuixar-"
"los, els punts es coloregen segons la seva classe."

